From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Domenico D'Arrigo <DCHEM88@hotmail.it>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 21:37:27 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 02/12] LvglPkg: Add a PCD for the default UI scale

The UI scale used before the user picks one in Graphical UI
Configuration is fixed to 1x. Take it from PcdLvglUiScaleDefault, like
the other layout defaults, so that a platform can start at the scale
that suits its panel. The PCD defaults to 1x.

Co-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_018n3yuWwDLW63F4vdf7ZFTv
---
 Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.c   | 2 +-
 Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.inf | 1 +
 LvglPkg.dec                                 | 4 ++++
 3 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.c b/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.c
index 2db5725..f1bb942 100644
--- a/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.c
+++ b/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.c
@@ -61,7 +61,7 @@ LvglUiConfigGetDefaults (
 {
   ASSERT (Config != NULL);
 
-  Config->UiScale                 = LVGL_UI_SCALE_DEFAULT;
+  Config->UiScale                   = PcdGet8 (PcdLvglUiScaleDefault);
   Config->CenteredFrameEnabled      = PcdGetBool (PcdLvglCenteredFrameEnabled) ? 1 : 0;
   Config->CenteredFrameHeightPct    = PcdGet8 (PcdLvglCenteredFrameHeightPct);
   Config->CenteredFrameAspectNum    = PcdGet8 (PcdLvglCenteredFrameAspectNum);
diff --git a/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.inf b/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.inf
index 9ef7769..f0fa92c 100644
--- a/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.inf
+++ b/Library/LvglUiConfigLib/LvglUiConfigLib.inf
@@ -32,6 +32,7 @@
   gLvglUiConfigFormSetGuid
 
 [Pcd]
+  gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglUiScaleDefault
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameEnabled
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameHeightPct
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglCenteredFrameAspectNum
diff --git a/LvglPkg.dec b/LvglPkg.dec
index 4bff149..995fec9 100644
--- a/LvglPkg.dec
+++ b/LvglPkg.dec
@@ -50,3 +50,7 @@
   ## show the form title in the subtitle bar and render the centered banner in
   ## the content area (original behavior).
   gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglAptioSubtitleShowsDeviceModel|FALSE|BOOLEAN|0x00000008
+
+  ## UI scale used until the user picks one in Graphical UI Configuration:
+  ## 0 = 1x, 3 = 1.25x, 1 = 1.5x, 2 = 2x (LVGL_UI_SCALE_* in Guid/LvglUiConfig.h).
+  gLvglPkgTokenSpaceGuid.PcdLvglUiScaleDefault|0|UINT8|0x00000009
-- 
2.43.0

